"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4808b8ffe26>`__, `dfc323b4ec7 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/dfc323b4ec7>`__, `61c077df9a5 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/61c077df9a5>`__, `8c2cd6cf1f1 "
